  "2026-10-29T11:11:39.888Z","harness:codex","Registry cutoff passed at 11:03:02 UTC on October 29. Installed Sentry CLI 3.8.2 and synchronized only its native packages in pnpm-lock.yaml; supported Node engine remains >=18. Actual binary reports 3.8.2. In an isolated temporary JavaScript/source-map fixture, sourcemaps inject produced matching debug IDs and the instrumented bundle still executed with expected output 42. No fixture was uploaded. The linked development-dependency integrity check passes; production code and runtime dependency versions are unchanged."
  "2026-10-29T11:21:04.081Z","harness:codex","Post-upgrade build, dependency cooldown policy, 42-package runtime-lock check, package-boundary audit and linked development-dependency integrity check pass. pnpm audit reports zero info/low/moderate/high/critical advisories across the unchanged 567-dependency inventory. Lockfile inspection limits the upgrade to Sentry CLI and its platform binaries. Current core source separately passes the full 11573-test exact-coverage suite; final hosted acceptance remains pending."
